---
---

<section id="segmentos" class="segments-section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">APLICAÇÃO PRÁTICA</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Como isso funciona <br />
        <span class="highlight">no seu negócio?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        O CRM, as automações e a IA podem ser combinados de acordo com a forma que sua empresa atende, vende e acompanha seus clientes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sticky Stacking Cards Container (Efeito de Scroll com Sobreposição e Desfoque) -->
    <div class="sticky-stack-container">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Consórcio & Crédito -->
      <div class="sticky-segment-card" style="--card-index: 0;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="segment-icon icon-teal">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"></rect>
              <line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="segment-flow-tag">Simulação em PDF + Pré-venda</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Consórcio & Crédito</h3>
        <p>Simulação → Orçamento em PDF → WhatsApp → IA aborda → qualifica → vendedor assume → follow-up</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Imobiliárias -->
      <div class="sticky-segment-card" style="--card-index: 1;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="segment-icon icon-blue">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="segment-flow-tag blue">Perfil Completo + Corretor</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Imobiliárias</h3>
        <p>Lead entra → informa o que procura → IA entende perfil e orçamento → qualifica → corretor recebe resumo</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Clínicas & Consultórios -->
      <div class="sticky-segment-card" style="--card-index: 2;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="segment-icon icon-purple">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="segment-flow-tag purple">Agenda Integrada + Lembretes</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Clínicas & Consultórios</h3>
        <p>Atende → tira dúvidas de procedimentos → consulta horários → agenda → confirma → lembra → remarca</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Barbearias & Estética -->
      <div class="sticky-segment-card" style="--card-index: 3;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="segment-icon icon-amber">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle>
              <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle>
              <line x1="20" y1="4" x2="8.12" y2="15.88"></line>
              <line x1="14.47" y1="14.48" x2="20" y2="20"></line>
              <line x1="8.12" y1="8.12" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="segment-flow-tag amber">Agendamento & Remarcação</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Barbearias & Estética</h3>
        <p>Mostra horários disponíveis → agenda procedimento → confirma presença → lembra → remarca se o cliente desmarcar</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Atacado & Distribuição -->
      <div class="sticky-segment-card" style="--card-index: 4;">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="segment-icon icon-coral">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
              <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
              <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="segment-flow-tag coral">Qualificação + Rodízio Vendedores</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Atacado & Distribuição</h3>
        <p>Atende → entende pedido → coleta quantidade e cidade → qualifica → envia para vendedor no rodízio → faz follow-up</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .segments-section {
    padding: 90px 0 120px;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #0f172a;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .shell {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 860px; /* Focused column width for elegant card stacking */
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.12);
    color: #008f70;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .section-title .highlight {
    color: #008f70;
  }

  .section-desc {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
  }

  /* Sticky Stacking Cards Container */
  .sticky-stack-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sticky-segment-card {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(100px + var(--card-index, 0) * 20px);
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 -4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02), 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .segment-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .svg-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }

  .icon-teal { background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.15); color: #008f70; }
  .icon-blue { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); color: #2563eb; }
  .icon-purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #9333ea; }
  .icon-amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #d97706; }
  .icon-coral { background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15); color: #ea580c; }

  .segment-flow-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #008f70;
    background: rgba(0, 168, 132, 0.12);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .segment-flow-tag.blue { color: #2563eb; background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12); }
  .segment-flow-tag.purple { color: #9333ea; background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); }
  .segment-flow-tag.amber { color: #d97706; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); }
  .segment-flow-tag.coral { color: #ea580c; background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12); }

  .sticky-segment-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .sticky-segment-card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
